# sequin, the chip voice, on track 2: picked from SEL's list (ENGINE, ten steps on from knit: the pickers step past cane's
# retired number), its first preset "sequin" (a quarter pulse, the chip's vibrato); a note played by hand and from the
# steps; the presets turned; the Sub page's chip, arp, vib and tone; EDIT held and ALGORITHM from bellows to voile
wait 300
spin ALGO 1
expect trk 2
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
tap SEL
row ENGINE
turn ALGO 10 30
tap SEL
wait 40
expect par2.engine 11
expect par2.e1 0
expect par2.e2 32
expect par2.x3 20
expect par2.x4 127
play 2 60 on 100
wait 200
expect voices 1
shot sequin_note.png
play 2 60 off
wait 600
step 2 1 1 60 100
step 2 1 5 67 100
tap PLAY
bars 0.05
expect playing 1
expect voices >0
bars 1
tap PLAY
wait 400
turn PRESET 1
wait 40
expect par2.engine 11
expect par2.e1 1
expect par2.x1 1
turn SELECT 3
expect page Sub
spin K1 4
expect par2.x1 4
spin K2 1
expect par2.x2 1
wait 100
shot sequin_sub.png
play 2 48 on 100
wait 300
expect voices 1
play 2 48 off
wait 400
param 2 engine 3
press EDIT
turn ALGO 1
expect par2.engine 5
wait 1200
turn ALGO -1
expect par2.engine 3
release EDIT
